State: default

Purpose:
  Define global state symbols used across all .sdd files.

Symbols:
  +: done
  ~: active
  -: failed
  !: blocked
  ?: decision required
  >: next
  @: reference
  #: task
  [!]: attention required
  [x]: completed
  [ ]: pending

Stages:
  AN: Analyze
  AR: Architecture
  DB: Database
  BE: Backend
  API: API
  FE: Frontend
  MD: Mobile
  QA: Quality Assurance
  DO: DevOps
  VR: Verify

Rules:
  [S1] State symbols MUST be used consistently across all .sdd files.
  [S2] AI MUST update state after completing each stage.
   [S3] State changes MUST be logged in decisions/.

State: +
